G. Political signs (see Chapter 17.108);
H. Directional signs not exceeding three (3) square feet in area;
I. Residential signs (see Chapter 17.108);
J. Signs of a governmental body, governmental agency or public authority, including traffic signs, traffic signals, traffic regulatory devices and warnings, official flags, emblems, official instruments, official public notices, and similar governmental signs or devices.
(Ord. No. 25-01-02, § 1, 1-2-2025)
